Package: CoCluster
Title: Allows Co-Clustering of Data Using the Latent Block Model with Native Support for CUB Ordinal Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Nam Dang", "VO", , "vonamdang03@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package leverages the **Latent Block Model (LBM)** equipped natively with the **Combination of Uniform and shifted Binomial (CUB)** observation model, tailored for ordinal data to account for both deliberate human choices and random uncertainty, and can easily be extended to use other models. It estimates the optimal co-clustering using the **SEM-Gibbs** algorithm and can automatically search for the optimal number of clusters using a greedy surface search algorithm and the **Integrated Completed Likelihood (ICL)** criterion.
